# Hybrid Monitor LUT
# Profile  : Sony S-Log3
# Cameras  : A7S III, A7 IV, FX3, FX6, FX9, ZV-E1, Venice
# Input    : Sony S-Log3 log / S-Gamut3.Cine
# Output   : Rec.709 base + narrow exposure tracer overlays
# Generator: hybrid_monitor_lut.py
#
# Base transform pipeline:
#   Log decode  →  S-Gamut3.Cine → Rec.709 matrix  →  Rec.709 OETF
#
# Overlay zones (thin tracers over Rec.709 base):
#   #ef4444     white_clip      log 0.760 – 1.000
#   #eab308     +2 stops        log 0.555 – 0.565
#   #d946ef     +1 stops        log 0.479 – 0.490
#   #22c55e     +0 stops        log 0.405 – 0.416
#   #06b6d4     -1 stops        log 0.334 – 0.344
#   #3b82f6     -2 stops        log 0.269 – 0.277
#   #6366f1     black_clip      log 0.000 – 0.100
#   All other levels → standard Rec.709 color (no tracer)
#
TITLE "HybridMonitor Sony S-Log3"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0
DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0

